Meta.documentation:List.filter
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:Keeps the elements of a flowing list for which a referenced
Meta.documentation:resource answers true.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:The predicate is referenced by URI (?|using=Boolean.not or a
Meta.documentation:flowing Reference). Each element is fed to a fresh predicate
Meta.documentation:processor; elements whose Boolean result is true pass through
Meta.documentation:with their own type.
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:A list can mix any types, so results cannot be bound at compile time:
Meta.documentation:like http:, the operator declares no typed outputs — it late-connects,
Meta.documentation:wrapping each result in its own typed resource at execution time and
Meta.documentation:connecting that to the downstream connectee (see docs/output-interfaces.md).
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@port in_Reference_using — the predicate, by reference
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_using_$explicit — the predicate's URI as a parameter string
Meta.documentation:@port in_String_$all — String element to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_Number_$all — Number element to test
Meta.documentation:@port in_Blob_$all — Blob element candidate
Meta.documentation:@port in_Boolean_$all — Boolean element to test
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@example
Meta.documentation:[Boolean:true Boolean:false]>>List.filter:?|using=Boolean.not>>Console:
Meta.documentation:---
Meta.documentation:false
Meta.documentation:
Meta.documentation:@see List.map Reference
Meta.documentation:@kind operator
Meta.documentation:@status stable

[Native.Javascript:const%20Resource%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Content-Type%2Fdata%2FResource%22)%3B%0Aconst%20castLib%20%20%20%3D%20Dawn.require(%22Scheme%2Fcast%22)%3B%0A%0A%2F%2F%20Keeps%20the%20elements%20of%20a%20flowing%20list%20for%20which%20a%20referenced%20resource%0A%2F%2F%20answers%20true.%20The%20predicate%20is%20referenced%20by%20URI%3A%20%3F%7Cusing%3DBoolean.not%20or%0A%2F%2F%20with%20Reference%3ABoolean.not%20in%20the%20flow.%20A%20list%20can%20mix%20any%20types%2C%20so%20each%0A%2F%2F%20kept%20element's%20type%20is%20known%20only%20at%20execution%20time%20%E2%80%94%20filter%20declares%20no%0A%2F%2F%20typed%20outputs%3B%20like%20http%3A%2C%20it%20late-connects%20each%20kept%20element%20in%20its%20own%0A%2F%2F%20typed%20resource.%0Afunction%20testElement(target%2C%20element)%20%2F%2F%20synchronous%20burst%2C%20keeps%20program%20lines%20from%20interleaving%0A%7B%0A%09let%20keep%20%3D%20false%3B%0A%09let%20op%20%3D%20target.instanciate_processor%20%3F%20target.instanciate_processor()%20%3A%20target%3B%0A%09op.out_Boolean%20%3D%20(o)%20%3D%3E%20%7B%20keep%20%3D%20!!o.value%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%09op.in_begin%3F.()%3B%0A%09let%20port%20%3D%20Object.keys(op).find(k%20%3D%3E%20k.startsWith(%22in_%22%20%2B%20element.type)%20%26%26%20!%5B%22in_begin%22%2C%22in_end%22%2C%22in_go%22%2C%22in_error%22%2C%22in_instanciate%22%5D.includes(k))%3B%0A%09if%20(port)%20op%5Bport%5D(%7B%20value%3A%20element.value%20%7D)%3B%0A%09op.in_end%3F.()%3B%0A%09return%20keep%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20filter()%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.call(this%2C%22filter%22)%3B%0A%09this.Processor%3DfilterProcessor%3B%0A%09return%20this%3B%0A%7D%0A%0Afunction%20filterProcessor(resource)%0A%7B%0A%09Resource.Processor.call(this%2Cresource)%3B%0A%09this.resource%20%3D%20resource%3B%0A%09this.in_begin%20%3D%20function()%0A%09%7B%0A%09%09this.using%20%3D%20null%3B%0A%09%09this.elements%20%3D%20%5B%5D%3B%0A%09%09return%20this.fire_end_parameters()%3B%20%2F%2F%20pre-positioned%20parameter%20inputs%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%20%20%20%20function%20collect(type)%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09return%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.elements.push(%7Btype%3Atype%2C%20value%3Ainput.value%7D)%3B%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%09this.in_Reference_using%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.using%20%3D%20input.reference%3B%20%7D%0A%09this.in_String_using_%24explicit%20%3D%20function(input)%20%7B%20this.using%20%3D%20input.value%3B%20%7D%20%2F%2F%20parameter%20drop-in%0A%09this.in_String_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22String%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Number_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22Number%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Boolean_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22Boolean%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_Blob_%24all%20%3D%20collect(%22Blob%22)%3B%0A%09this.in_end%20%3D%20async%20function()%0A%20%20%20%20%7B%0A%09%09if%20(!this.using)%0A%09%09%09return%20this%3F.out_error%3F.(%7Bvalue%3A%22filter%3A%20missing%20'using'%20parameter%20(e.g.%20%3F%7Cusing%3DBoolean.not)%22%7D)%3B%0A%09%09let%20target%20%3D%20await%20this.lookup(this.using%20%2B%20%22%3A%22)%3B%0A%09%09if%20(!target)%0A%09%09%09return%20this%3F.out_error%3F.(%7Bvalue%3A%22filter%3A%20cannot%20resolve%20Reference%3A%22%20%2B%20this.using%7D)%3B%0A%09%09for%20(let%20i%20in%20this.elements)%0A%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09if%20(!testElement(target%2C%20this.elements%5Bi%5D)%20%7C%7C%20!this.connectee)%20continue%3B%0A%09%09%09%2F%2F%20late%20connect%20(like%20http%3A)%20%E2%80%94%20the%20type%20is%20known%20only%20now%0A%09%09%09let%20cast%20%3D%20castLib.castValue(this.elements%5Bi%5D.type%2C%20this.elements%5Bi%5D.value)%3B%0A%09%09%09if%20(cast)%0A%09%09%09%7B%0A%09%09%09%09cast.connect(this.connectee)%3B%0A%09%09%09%09cast.in_go%3F.()%3B%0A%09%09%09%7D%0A%09%09%7D%0A%20%20%20%20%7D%0A%7D%0Afilter.Processor%3DfilterProcessor%3B%0Amodule.exports%3Dfilter%3B]>>NewResource:List.filter
